'''Shakurel Tiger''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and can be unlocked by purchasing a special sale which contains Shakurel Tiger and 400 [[Cat Food]] during the [[Shakurel Planet Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 499
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Shakurel Tiger
|name2 = Shakurel Tiger CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shakurel Tiger CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although his attack power looks promising, it is severely hindered by his high recharge time, lacking HP, and low range. Early game he can find a use but he quickly falls off after EoC. It's barrier break is completely rendered useless by it's low range and proc chance as well, so overall this unit's only use is filling user rank.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

